  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Turkiye-Syria Earthquakes Appeal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Act now and help save lives.  Thousands of people have been killed and over 17,000 people have been injured after two major earthquakes struck Turkiye and northern Syria on Monday 6 February. You can help. The scale of need is immense, with many thousands of people in desperate need of emergency relief assistance such as first aid, health, shelter, and non-food items Donate now to our Turkiye-Syria Earthquakes Appeal to help ensure that the people of Syria and Turkiye receive lifesaving support.</narrative>
  </description>
